stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending

    state Pending {
        [*] --> PodStarting
        PodStarting --> Ready : Pod Ready\n(no clients)
        Ready --> PodStarting : Pod restart
    }

    Pending --> Idle : Primeiro Ready\n(nclients == 0)

    Idle --> Allocated : Controller /allocate\nmap stream→worker
    Allocated --> Streaming : FFmpeg conecta\nRTMP publish /live/streamX

    Streaming --> Idle : Cliente encerra stream\nFFmpeg killed\nnclients == 0\nController /release

    Streaming --> Terminating : Pod being deleted\n(by autoscale or cluster)
    Terminating --> [*]

    Idle --> Terminating : Scale-down / delete\nworker sem streams

    note right of Idle
      Worker Ready e sem clientes RTMP
      Pode ser alocado para qualquer stream
      (stream_to_worker não o aponta)
    end note

    note right of Streaming
      Worker com 1 conexão RTMP ativa
      max_connections = 1
      Reservado para uma única stream
    end note
